~ start
A red book with gold markings on it, a tassled bookmark hanging out the edge.
if Global.has_knife == false
	And a knife. Just great.
~ menu
if Global.has_knife == false
	- Open the book
		You turn the page to where the bookmark is holding a place.
		Marked passage: A good offering requires sacrifice.
		Marked passage: A lock of hair is best at this point in your journey, but a scrap of fabric will also do.
		Marked: Each of them burn just as brightly!
		You leaf through the rest of the book but it's all just blank pages.
		set Global.read_book = true
	- Take the knife
		There's nothing special about the knife on the surface, but it seems very sharp.
		I really hope I don't need this, but it's coming with me.
		set Global.has_knife = true
	=> menu
if Global.has_knife == true
	- Open the book
		You turn the page to where the bookmark is holding a place.
		Marked passage: A good offering requires sacrifice.
		Marked passage: A lock of hair is best at this point in your journey, but a scrap of fabric will also do.
		Marked: Each of them burn just as brightly!
		You leaf through the rest of the book but it's all just blank pages.
		set Global.read_book = true
		=> END

=> END